ent-ClothingOuterHardsuitJuggernaut = 「網路太陽」巨無霸戰甲 | cybersun juggernaut suit
    .desc = 這套防護服由 Cybersun 尖端研發部門打造，具備極高的韌性。 | A suit made by the cutting edge R&D department at cybersun to be hyper resilient.
ent-ClothingOuterHardsuitWizard = 巫師重型機甲 | wizard hardsuit
    .desc = 一套鑲滿寶石、散發著魔法能量的奇特西裝。 | A bizarre gem-encrusted suit that radiates magical energies.
ent-ClothingOuterHardsuitLing = 有機太空服 | organic space suit
    .desc = 一種適用於太空環境、能耐受壓力與高溫的生物質組織。 | A spaceworthy biomass of pressure and temperature resistant tissue.
ent-ClothingOuterHardsuitPirateEVA = 深空太空行走服 | deep space EVA suit
    .desc = 一套笨重的太空服，能提供基本的防護，抵禦深空嚴酷寒冷的環境。 | A heavy space suit that provides some basic protection from the cold harsh realities of deep space.
    .suffix = Pirate
