ent-ClothingOuterHardsuitClown = 小丑硬式裝甲 | clown hardsuit
    .desc = 一套量身訂製的小丑硬式裝甲。 | A custom-made clown hardsuit.
ent-ClothingOuterHardsuitMime = MIME 重型戰甲 | mime hardsuit
